  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"這是一個 Serilum 模組。充滿愛意打造。為 Fabric、Forge 和 Neo 提供大量活躍的模組！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"關於本模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>「固定鐵砧修復費用」是一款極簡且可配置的模組，會對鐵砧進行一些修改。你可以設定每次修復所需的經驗等級數，且此費用將永久固定，不會隨著修復次數增加而提高。此外，還可以設定修復所需的材料數量，以及每次操作能修復物品的百分比。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依賴項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/serilums-extra-bundle\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/extra-bundle.svg&w=700\" alt=\"收錄於 Serilum 的額外模組包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"執行環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置選項\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用的配置選項：</p>\n<details><summary>顯示詳情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>repairCostLevelAmount</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 3，最小值 0，最大值 100<br>在鐵砧上修復物品所需的等級數。設為 0 則維持原版行為。<br><br><span><strong>repairCostMaterialAmount</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 1，最小值 0，最大值 64<br>在鐵砧上修復物品所需的材料數量。設為 0 則維持原版行為。<br><br><span><strong>percentRepairedPerAction</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;預設值 0.3333，最小值 0，最大值 1.0<br>每次操作修復物品的百分比。預設為 33.33%，因此使用 3 個 'repairCostMaterialAmount' 即可完全修復任何物品。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"實機畫面\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>使用預設設定修復鞘翅：</strong></span><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/fixed-anvil-repair-cost/a.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"610\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"備註與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>只要下載來源仍託管於 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統中，您可以自由在任何整合包中使用此模組。</strong></span><br><br><span><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a> 提供了所有可用模組的概覽與更多資訊。</span><br><span><br>若有問題、想法、建議或其他事項，請至&nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github 倉庫</a> 反饋。謝謝！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
